  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Return and Reintegration Assistance Program for Migrants under the Foreigner Law in the Canton of Vaud (Phase XV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cantonal program, run in collaboration between IOM Switzerland and the Service de la Population of the Canton of Vaud provides return and reintegration assistance to 50 migrants in situation of vulnerability, under the foreigner law in the canton of Vaud or to asylum seekers accepted in this framework.</narrative>
  </description>
